      "Title": "Zaya.Translator.Services.ITranslationCache",
      "Summary": "<p sourcefile=\"docs/api/Zaya.Translator.Services.ITranslationCache.yml\" sourcestartlinenumber=\"1\">A cache store for translation results, keyed by source text.\nImplementations can add custom eviction policies, TTL, or persistence.</p>\n"
    },
