      "IsMRef": true,
      "Title": "Zaya.Translator.Services.ITranslatorService",
      "Summary": "<p sourcefile=\"docs/api/Zaya.Translator.Services.ITranslatorService.yml\" sourcestartlinenumber=\"1\">Provides text translation capabilities.\nSource and target languages are declared via <xref href=\"Zaya.Translator.Services.ITranslatorService.Settings\" data-throw-if-not-resolved=\"false\"></xref> and passed at session creation.</p>\n"
    },
    {
      "type": "ManagedReference",
