        }
      },
      "version": "",
      "Uid": null,
      "IsMRef": true,
      "Title": "Zaya.Translator.Services.ITranslatorSession",
      "Summary": "<p sourcefile=\"docs/api/Zaya.Translator.Services.ITranslatorSession.yml\" sourcestartlinenumber=\"1\">Represents an active translation session with a fixed language pair and configuration.</p>\n"
    },
    {
      "type": "ManagedReference",
      "source_relative_path": "docs/api/Zaya.Translator.Services.Impl.CacheFactory.yml",
      "output": {
        ".html": {
          "relative_path": "api/Zaya.Translator.Services.Impl.CacheFactory.html"
        }
      },
      "version": "",
      "Uid": null,
      "IsMRef": true,
      "Title": "Zaya.Translator.Services.Impl.CacheFactory",
      "Summary": "<p sourcefile=\"docs/api/Zaya.Translator.Services.Impl.CacheFactory.yml\" sourcestartlinenumber=\"1\">Factory that conditionally wraps an <xref href=\"Zaya.Translator.Services.ITranslatorSession\" data-throw-if-not-resolved=\"false\"></xref>\nwith a <xref href=\"Zaya.Translator.Services.Impl.CachingTranslatorSession\" data-throw-if-not-resolved=\"false\"></xref> based on engine settings.\nTranslators call <xref href=\"Zaya.Translator.Services.Impl.CacheFactory.TryWrap(Zaya.Translator.Services.ITranslatorSession%2cZaya.Primitives.SettingDescriptorList)\" data-throw-if-not-resolved=\"false\"></xref> in their <code>CreateSessionAsync</code>\nto add caching transparently when enabled by the user.</p>\n"
    },
    {
      "type": "ManagedReference",
      "source_relative_path": "docs/api/Zaya.Translator.Services.Impl.CacheSettingDescriptors.yml",
      "output": {
        ".html": {
          "relative_path": "api/Zaya.Translator.Services.Impl.CacheSettingDescriptors.html"
        }
      },
      "version": "",
      "Uid": null,
      "IsMRef": true,
      "Title": "Zaya.Translator.Services.Impl.CacheSettingDescriptors",
      "Summary": "<p sourcefile=\"docs/api/Zaya.Translator.Services.Impl.CacheSettingDescriptors.yml\" sourcestartlinenumber=\"1\">Provides the <xref href=\"Zaya.Primitives.SettingDescriptor\" data-throw-if-not-resolved=\"false\"></xref> list for cache configuration.\nTranslators include <xref href=\"Zaya.Translator.Services.Impl.CacheSettingDescriptors.All\" data-throw-if-not-resolved=\"false\"></xref> in their own <code>BuildSettings()</code>\nreturn value so that the cache settings are rendered and read together with\nthe translator's own settings.</p>\n"
    },
    {
      "type": "ManagedReference",
      "source_relative_path": "docs/api/Zaya.Translator.Services.Impl.CacheSettingsKeys.yml",
      "output": {
        ".html": {
          "relative_path": "api/Zaya.Translator.Services.Impl.CacheSettingsKeys.html"
        }
      },
      "version": "",
      "Uid": null,
      "IsMRef": true,
      "Title": "Zaya.Translator.Services.Impl.CacheSettingsKeys",
      "Summary": "<p sourcefile=\"docs/api/Zaya.Translator.Services.Impl.CacheSettingsKeys.yml\" sourcestartlinenumber=\"1\">Machine-readable keys for translation cache settings.\nThese keys are passed as part of the engine settings dictionary\nand consumed by <xref href=\"Zaya.Translator.Services.Impl.CacheFactory.TryWrap(Zaya.Translator.Services.ITranslatorSession%2cZaya.Primitives.SettingDescriptorList)\" data-throw-if-not-resolved=\"false\"></xref>.</p>\n"
    },
    {
      "type": "ManagedReference",
      "source_relative_path": "docs/api/Zaya.Translator.Services.Impl.CachingTranslatorSession.yml",
      "output": {
        ".html": {
          "relative_path": "api/Zaya.Translator.Services.Impl.CachingTranslatorSession.html"
        }
      },
      "version": "",
      "Uid": null,
      "IsMRef": true,
      "Title": "Zaya.Translator.Services.Impl.CachingTranslatorSession",
      "Summary": "<p sourcefile=\"docs/api/Zaya.Translator.Services.Impl.CachingTranslatorSession.yml\" sourcestartlinenumber=\"1\">Decorator over <xref href=\"Zaya.Translator.Services.ITranslatorSession\" data-throw-if-not-resolved=\"false\"></xref> that caches translation results\nusing an <xref href=\"Zaya.Translator.Services.ITranslationCache\" data-throw-if-not-resolved=\"false\"></xref> instance. Both single-text and batch\n<code>TranslateAsync</code> calls are intercepted: cached texts are returned\nimmediately, and only uncached texts are forwarded to the inner session.</p>\n"
    },
