        ".html": {
          "relative_path": "api/Zaya.Translator.Services.MemoryTranslationCache.html"
        }
      },
      "version": "",
      "Uid": null,
      "IsMRef": true,
      "Title": "Zaya.Translator.Services.MemoryTranslationCache",
      "Summary": "<p sourcefile=\"docs/api/Zaya.Translator.Services.MemoryTranslationCache.yml\" sourcestartlinenumber=\"1\">In-memory implementation of <xref href=\"Zaya.Translator.Services.ITranslationCache\" data-throw-if-not-resolved=\"false\"></xref> with optional\ntime-to-live (TTL) eviction. Expired entries are removed lazily on access.\nThread-safe only for single-threaded consumers (the translation loop is single-threaded).</p>\n"
    },
